"Units are K,M,G,T,P,E,Z,Y (powers of 1024) or KB,MB,... (powers of 1000).\n"
"Binary prefixes can be used, too: KiB=K, MiB=M, and so on.\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/system.h:601
